# Static review CLIs baked into the Hermes Cat Paw image at build time.
# Live network scanners (nmap, subfinder, nuclei, ffuf, ProjectDiscovery
# httpx) are not here — they must run on Latch so the target sees the
# owner's IP. Playbooks stay a runtime clone (cybersecurity-skills.pin).
#
# kind=tar  GitHub tarball; installer finds the binary named `tool`
# kind=bin  raw binary
# kind=uv   uv tool install tool==version
# kind=apt  Debian package (name = tool)

